# .graphignore
# Keeps the native `graph` code graph on real project source.
# Format is gitignore-style; the `graph` tool reads this at the project root
# when it indexes. Matched files are excluded from the symbol/call graph.

# ── Agent / tooling state (already gitignored, not product code) ──
# GSD local runtime/state: vendored python-packages/redis copy, a docker
# build-context copy of api/ under runtime/docker/onnx1024-context, and hundreds
# of runtime/exec/*.meta.json files. Maintainer-workspace artifacts.
/.gsd/
/.gsd-backups/
# GitNexus second-opinion index state (its own store, not source).
/.gitnexus/
# Agent / shell / browser session state.
/.bg-shell/
/.artifacts/
/.jules/
/.pytest_cache/
/.claude/
/.compound-engineering/

# ── Generated / model / research artifacts (0-symbol noise for a Go code graph) ──
# Generated benchmark/closure reports: text and markdown, no code symbols.
/benchmark-results/
# Working issue & design notes (markdown, not source).
/documents/
# Downloaded TEI model weights, tokenizer, and huggingface cache (gitignored).
/tei-models/
# Historical ONNX research artifacts; README: "not part of the current
# deployment path". Kept out of the live-service graph.
/docs/onnx-artifacts/
